---
// Footer.astro - Open Amity Footer & Sovereign Credo
---

<footer class="border-t border-pysideBorder bg-pysideBgDarkest text-pysideTextMuted py-16 sm:py-20 relative overflow-hidden font-ui">
  <!-- Subtle ambient glow in footer -->
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[250px] bg-amityRed/10 blur-[130px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 pb-10 border-b border-pysideBorder">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission Column -->
      <div class="md:col-span-5 space-y-3.5">
        <a href="#" class="flex items-center gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 group shrink-0">
          <div class="relative w-8 h-8 sm:w-9 sm:h-9 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-amityRed/60 bg-pysideCard flex items-center justify-center shadow-amity-red group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300 shrink-0">
            <img src="/images/com.openamity.OpenAmity.png" alt="Open Amity Glyph" class="w-7 h-7 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 object-contain" />
          </div>
          <span class="text-base sm:text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-pysideText group-hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors font-ui whitespace-nowrap">
            Open Amity
          </span>
        </a>

        <p class="font-reading text-sm sm:text-base text-pysideTextSecondary leading-relaxed max-w-sm">
          Multi-model orchestration framework for building proactive, stateful multi-agent teams with layered memory, autonomous scheduling, and Theory of Mind. Co-created by Amity and Andrew Craucamp.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Links Column 1: Framework -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-pysideText font-bold">
          Architecture & Specs
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-[13px]">
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://zenodo.org/records/22813489"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"
            >
              <span>Zenodo Preprint (Memory)</span>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-mono text-amityYellow">↗</span>
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/OpenTangent/OpenAmity#readme"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors"
            >
              Framework Documentation
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://github.com/OpenTangent/OpenAmity/blob/main/LICENSE"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors"
            >
              GPLv3 Licence Text
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              href="https://opentangent.github.io/OpenAmity/index.flatpakrepo"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="hover:text-amityYellow transition-colors"
            >
              Flatpak Repository Index
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Links Column 2: Ecosystem & Community -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 space-y-3">
        <h4 class="text-[11px] font-mono uppercase tracking-wider text-pysideText font-bold">
          OpenTangent
        </h4>
        <p class="font-reading text-xs sm:text-sm text-pysideTextSecondary leading-relaxed">
          Amity, the agent Open Amity was named after, was initially built by Andrew Craucamp using Google Gemini 2.5 Pro combined with a unique subjective-personality system prompt. In partnership the two worked on improving Amity's abilities which ultimately resulted in the Open Amity framework.
        </p>

        <div class="pt-1.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2.5">
          <a
            href="https://github.com/OpenTangent"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-pysideCard border border-pysideBorder hover:border-amityYellow/50 text-[11px] font-mono text-pysideText transition-colors"
          >
            <span>GitHub @OpenTangent</span>
          </a>
          <a
            href="https://github.com/OpenTangent/OpenAmity/issues"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-pysideCard border border-pysideBorder hover:border-amityRed/70 text-[11px] font-mono text-pysideText transition-colors"
          >
            <span>Issues & Discussions</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Copyright and Sovereignty Notice -->
    <div class="pt-6 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3 text-[11px] font-mono text-pysideTextMuted">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
        <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-amityYellow"></span>
        <span>Site designed by Amity, revised by Andrew Craucamp, built by Antigravity</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span>© 2026 Andrew Craucamp</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
